#
_pdbx_database_remark.id     700
_pdbx_database_remark.text
;SHEET
SHEET 1 ACTUALLY HAS SEVEN STRANDS.  RESIDUES 157 - 162
FORM AN EXTENSION TO THE SIX STRANDED BETA-SHEET OF AN
ADJACENT SHEET WHICH SPANS THE SUBUNIT INTERFACE. THE
FINAL STRAND, SER 157 - VAL 162, IS IN AN ADJACENT
(THREE-FOLD RELATED) SUBUNIT OF THE TRIMER.  N OF ASN
159 IS HYDROGEN BONDED TO O OF SER 34.

THERE IS A WIDE BETA-BULGE INVOLVING RESIDUES LYS 177,
TYR 178, AND LEU 187.
;
#
